# ============================================================================
# FUZEBALL — .gitignore
#
# Everything listed here is either reinstallable, regenerable, or a local
# safety copy. Nothing here is needed to build or run the game from a fresh
# clone. Assets (assets/, vendor/, fonts/) are deliberately NOT ignored — they
# ARE the game, and vendor/ is committed on purpose so a packaged build never
# has to touch the network. See the note at the top of index.html.
# ============================================================================

# --- npm packages -----------------------------------------------------------
# Restored with:  cd tools && npm install
# tools/package.json and tools/package-lock.json are committed, so the exact
# versions come back. Was 563 files / 63 MB, including an 18 MB Windows DLL
# stored twice over and basisu binaries for macOS and Linux that never run here.
node_modules/

# --- local backup copies ----------------------------------------------------
# The single biggest thing in this repo: 59 files, 418 MB — safety copies left
# beside a model before re-exporting it. Git history is already the backup, so
# committing these stores the same model twice, forever.
*.bak

# --- machine-local tool state -----------------------------------------------
# "local" in the name: this is per-machine, not project config.
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- VS Code ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal editor state stays out; genuinely shared project settings (such as
# files.eol, which keeps line endings consistent) can be committed.
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

# --- OS junk ----------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- editor / temp ----------------------------------------------------------
*.swp
*~
*.tmp
tmp/
.cache/

# --- logs -------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
